                "query": "-- Reinícios de container (OOMKill aparece aqui)\r\nFROM K8sContainerSample SELECT sum(restartCountDelta) AS 'Reinícios'\r\nWHERE clusterName = 'techchallenge-prod' AND namespaceName = 'techchallenge'\r\nFACET podName SINCE 24 hours ago TIMESERIES 30 minutes"
